  My recommendation is [1mvanilla + [38;5;153mlocalStorage[39m, with storage behind a small module[0m so the IndexedDB question stays
  answerable later. Frameworks earn their keep when the UI gets complex; a task list with due dates isn't there, and the
  build step is real ongoing cost. If you already know this grows into something bigger, React now saves a migration.
